<title>PHILIPPINES: Urban Bank 96 net at 361 mln pesos - report.</title>
<headline>Urban Bank 96 net at 361 mln pesos - report.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Bank  posted a net income of 361 million pesos in 1996, up 56 percent from 232 million pesos in 1995, a newspaper report said on Friday.</p>
<p>The report in the Philippine Journal cited documents submitted to the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The bank attributed the increase in earnings to a rise in interest income and equity earnings of affiliates, the report said.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
